---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BrandyImg from '../assets/brandy.png';
import BrandybytegamesLayout from '../layouts/brandybytegamesLayout.astro';
---
<BrandybytegamesLayout>
	<h2>What is Brandy Byte Games</h2>
	<p>
		Brandy Byte Games is a studio founded by a solo developer named Michael.
		The name comes from Michael's dog, Brandy.
		
	</p>
	<h2>Who is Brandy?</h2>
	<p>
		Brandy is my German Shepherd. She's a silly dog who loves playing with
		her frisbee and lounging about when I'm working during the day.
		<br>
		<!-- change this... -->
		<Image src={BrandyImg} alt="Brandy Byte Games" width="143" height="240" />
	</p>
	<h2>What kind of games do you make?</h2>
	<p>
		We make whatever sounds fun to work on. We've not nailed down a specific genre
		or style, but we'll figure that out as we go. That's what makes this fun, right?
	</p>
</BrandybytegamesLayout>
